  "reason": "The top-5 experiments strongly favor scvi_n200 + transformer aggregation, with the best accuracy (0.725) from config_049 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted). However, config_047 (scvi_n200 + resnet50 + transformer + weighted) achieved the highest F1 (0.695), suggesting resnet50 may pair well with certain fusion strategies. Config_039 (scvi_n200 + resnet50 + transformer + concat) is the only untested cell in the critical 2×2 (image_encoder × fusion) grid under the dominant scvi_n200 + transformer setting. Testing it clarifies whether concat fusion rescues or improves upon resnet50's accuracy gap (0.713 vs 0.725), and whether the F1 advantage of resnet50 translates into an accuracy gain with a different fusion. This is the highest-value exploitation step: it completes the key comparison within the proven-best neighborhood, and with 4 experiments remaining, narrowing the optimal image-encoder/fusion pairing is essential before any fine-tuning."
